ent-RUMCWoodenShovel = wooden shovel
    .desc = A shovel carved of wood. Good for the ground and the clay, but it will not last: two blocks, and it is gone.
ent-RUMCWoodenPickaxe = wooden pickaxe
    .desc = A pickaxe of hard wood. It gets through the soft rock, but it will not last: two blocks, and it is gone.
ent-RUMCStoneShovel = stone shovel
    .desc = A shovel with a blade of flaked stone. It digs better than the wooden one and lasts six blocks.
ent-RUMCStonePickaxe = stone pickaxe
    .desc = A pickaxe with a head of flaked stone. It breaks the rock better than the wooden one and lasts six blocks.

